eng11AddSection("eng11-u17",{"id": "eng11-s167-adverb-position-end", "title": "Grammar: position of adverbs (end) · Teacher's Guideline", "headingUrdu": "قواعد: قیود کی جگہ (اختتام) · استاد کی رہنمائی", "headingPashto": "ګرامر: د قیدونو ځای (پای) · د ښوونکي لارښوونه", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 167, "printedPage": "158"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["eng11-s167-g4", "eng11-s167-g5", "eng11-s167-g6", "eng11-s167-g7", "eng11-s167-g8", "eng11-s167-g9", "eng11-s167-g10", "eng11-s167-g11", "eng11-s167-g12", "eng11-s167-tg", "eng11-s167-tgt"]}], "equations": [], "sourceNote": "Printed page 158. Items 4–12 of the adverb-position exercise (the page begins with \"4. He got dressed. (in a hurry)\"), then a large blank space and the pink \"Teacher's Guideline\" banner. Border lines, a pink corner flag, the watermark and the \"Whatsapp\" strip are excluded. The page number 158 is printed in a diamond at the foot.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-12T15:15:55.781119+00:00", "scope": "Scan 167 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
eng11Pair("4. He got dressed. (in a hurry)","4. اس نے کپڑے پہنے۔ (in a hurry)","4. هغه جامې واغوستې. (in a hurry)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g4", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("5. She realized her mistake. (at once)","5. اسے اپنی غلطی کا احساس ہوا۔ (at once)","5. هغې خپله غلطي پوه شوه. (at once)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g5", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("6. We are invited to parties at the weekends. (often)","6. ہمیں ہفتے کے آخر میں پارٹیوں میں مدعو کیا جاتا ہے۔ (often)","6. موږ د اونۍ په پای کې محفلونو ته بلل کېږو. (often)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g6", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("7. She has done everything – she has been a soldier. (even)","7. اس نے سب کچھ کیا ہے – وہ سپاہی بھی رہی ہے۔ (even)","7. هغې هر څه کړي دي – هغه سرتېرې هم وه. (even)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g7", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("8. I have finished painting the house. (almost)","8. میں نے گھر پر رنگ کرنا تقریباً ختم کر لیا ہے۔ (almost)","8. ما د کور رنګول نږدې بشپړ کړي دي. (almost)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g8", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("9. Could you switch the light? (off)","9. کیا آپ بتی بند کر دیں گے؟ (off)","9. ایا تاسو څراغ بند کولای شئ؟ (off)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g9", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("10. We go to our native place in summer. (usually)","10. ہم گرمیوں میں اپنے آبائی علاقے جاتے ہیں۔ (usually)","10. موږ په اوړي کې خپل اصلي ځای ته ځو. (usually)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g10", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("11. Your sewing machine needs some oil. (just)","11. آپ کی سلائی مشین کو کچھ تیل چاہیے۔ (just)","11. ستاسو د ګنډلو ماشین ته لږ غوړي په کار دي. (just)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g11", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("12. It will rain this evening. (probably)","12. آج شام بارش ہوگی۔ (probably)","12. نن ماښام به باران وشي. (probably)",{"id": "eng11-s167-g12", "role": "question", "exerciseId": "eng11-u17-grammar", "tab": "grammar"}),
eng11Pair("Teacher’s Guideline:","استاد کی رہنمائی:","د ښوونکي لارښوونه:",{"id": "eng11-s167-tg", "kind": "heading"}),
eng11Pair("Explain and revise with the students the use of varying positions of adverbs.","طلبہ کو قیود (adverbs) کی مختلف جگہوں کے استعمال کی وضاحت کریں اور اس کا اعادہ کریں۔","زده کوونکو ته د قیدونو (adverbs) د بېلابېلو ځایونو کارول تشریح او تکرار کړئ.",{"id": "eng11-s167-tgt"})
]});
